{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oloiTlceq71795355706.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中巡網球賽香港公開賽開幕。</p><p></p><p>開幕禮在維園中央球場舉行，文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩向球手送上紀念品。</p><p></p><p>這日先舉行名人賽，周一開始打預選賽，正賽周三展開，決賽下周日舉行。設男、女子單打及雙打，港將王康怡、黃俊鏗等都會出戰。總獎金80萬人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:03:50.665333+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:37:32.100999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:17.483287+00:00","content_hash":"a9c3a88c6c4a2c084fdb1603655c416275b892f747852f9f6d6e49188bcfb763","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:03:50.665333+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}